14px;line-height:20px;color:#142a25;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-weigh=
t:700;">A test for your receiving team</p>=0A<p style=3D"margin:0;font-fami=
ly:&apos;DM Sans&apos;,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&apos;Segoe UI&apos=
;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#=
3f4f47;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;">Pick one supplier lot from last month=
. Can your team connect it to its PO, shipment, certificate, receipt, insp=
ection, and downstream use without rebuilding the story from email threads =
and separate systems=3F If the answer takes a day of digging, the handshake=
 is already broken.</p>=0A</td></tr>=0A</tbody></table>=0A<table role=3D"pr=
